Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:06:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] AAF import: drop a running analysis when the file or
 media folder changes

window.import_aaf (and opening an .aaf) can set a new path while the
previous file is still being analyzed; its late plan could then be shown and
imported for the new path.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
